  "type": "page",
  "content": "<a href=\"/#portofolio\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M257.5 445.1l-22.2 22.2c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0L7 273c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L201.4 44.7c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l22.2 22.2c9.5 9.5 9.3 25-.4 34.3L136.6 216H424c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24v32c0 13.3-10.7 24-24 24H136.6l120.5 114.8c9.8 9.3 10 24.8.4 34.3z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tBack\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t<p>Project &gt;</p><p>Sharesa Digital</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Sharesa Digital — Agency Suite</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p data-path-to-node=\"4\"><b data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Project Overview:</b> Sharesa Digital is a high-performance platform engineered for modern digital agencies. It serves as a centralized hub for managing portfolios, streamlining client intake, and showcasing agency services with a focus on ultra-fast load times and seamless data synchronization.</p><p data-path-to-node=\"5\"><b data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Challenge (Problem):</b> Many agency websites are built on bloated CMS platforms that suffer from slow performance and rigid structures. This results in high bounce rates and a poor first impression for high-ticket clients who expect a smooth, professional digital experience.</p><p data-path-to-node=\"6\"><b data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Solution (Engineering &amp; Design):</b></p><ul data-path-to-node=\"7\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Modern Backend:</b> Built with <b data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"27\">Laravel 11</b>, utilizing the latest features for robust performance and elegant code architecture.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Hybrid Data Layer:</b> Integrated <b data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"30\">Supabase</b> for real-time database capabilities and secure authentication, combined with <b data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"116\">Cloudinary</b> for lightning-fast, optimized asset delivery.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Conversion-Centric UI:</b> Designed a high-conversion intake system that simplifies the client journey from \"Interest\" to \"Inquiry,\" ensuring no lead is lost due to friction.</p></li></ul>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>🔗Link</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://sharesa-digital-production.up.railway.app/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tLive Demo\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"08b9e04\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"12\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTk3OCwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL2toYWlyYW4udGVjaFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNVwvMDdcLzEyLTIucG5nIiwic2xpZGVzaG93IjoiMDhiOWUwNCJ9\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/12-2.png\"><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/12-2.png\" alt=\"12\" /></figure></a><a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"08b9e04\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"13\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTk3OSwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL2toYWlyYW4udGVjaFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNVwvMDdcLzEzLTEucG5nIiwic2xpZGVzaG93IjoiMDhiOWUwNCJ9\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/13-1.png\"><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/13-1.png\" alt=\"13\" /></figure></a><a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"08b9e04\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"14\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTk4MCwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL2toYWlyYW4udGVjaFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNVwvMDdcLzE0LTEucG5nIiwic2xpZGVzaG93IjoiMDhiOWUwNCJ9\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/14-1.png\"><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/14-1.png\" alt=\"14\" /></figure></a><a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"08b9e04\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"15\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTk4MSwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL2toYWlyYW4udGVjaFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNVwvMDdcLzE1LTEucG5nIiwic2xpZGVzaG93IjoiMDhiOWUwNCJ9\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/15-1.png\"><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/15-1.png\" alt=\"15\" /></figure></a>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 1000\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M646 125C629 125 613 133 604 142L308 442C296 454 292 471 292 487 292 504 296 521 308 533L604 854C617 867 629 875 646 875 663 875 679 871 692 858 704 846 713 829 713 812 713 796 708 779 692 767L438 487 692 225C700 217 708 204 708 187 708 171 704 154 692 142 675 129 663 125 646 125Z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 1000\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M696 533C708 521 713 504 713 487 713 471 708 454 696 446L400 146C388 133 375 125 354 125 338 125 325 129 313 142 300 154 292 171 292 187 292 204 296 221 308 233L563 492 304 771C292 783 288 800 288 817 288 833 296 850 308 863 321 871 338 875 354 875 371 875 388 867 400 854L696 533Z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p><b data-path-to-node=\"21\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Result:</b> A professional, blazingly fast agency platform that effectively bridges the gap between creative services and technical excellence. Sharesa Digital empowers agencies to scale their operations with a website that is as high-performing as their services.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2> <strong data-start=\"393\" data-end=\"407\">Tech Stack</strong></h2>\t\t\t\t\n    Laravel 11\n    Supabase\n    Cloudinary\n    Tailwind CSS\n<style>\n.kh-stack-grid {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    gap: 10px;\n    margin: 15px 0;\n}\n.kh-badge {\n    padding: 6px 14px;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n    transition: all 0.3s ease;\n}\n.kh-badge:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }\n/* Sharesa Colors */\n.laravel { background-color: #FF2D20; color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #c7251b; }\n.supabase { background-color: #3ecf8e; color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #2e9b6a; }\n.cloudinary { background-color: #3448c5; color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #2a3a9e; }\n.tailwind { background-color: #06B6D4; color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #0891b2; }\n</style>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>🧩 <strong data-start=\"393\" data-end=\"407\">Topic Area</strong></h2>\t\t\t\t\n    🏢 Agency Solutions\n    🚀 High Performance\n    🔗 Lead Generation\n    ☁️ Cloud Infrastructure\n<style>\n.topic-container-horizontal {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    gap: 10px;\n    margin-top: 15px;\n}\n.topic-pill-v2 {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\n    padding: 6px 14px;\n    border-radius: 50px;\n    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    transition: all 0.3s ease;\n}\n.topic-icon { margin-right: 8px; font-size: 16px; }\n</style>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>🛠️ <strong data-start=\"946\" data-end=\"961\">Skills Used</strong></h2>\t\t\t\t\n            Full-stack Dev (Laravel 11)\n            100%\n            Cloud Database (Supabase)\n            100%\n            Asset Optimization\n            100%\n<style>\n.skills-used-container { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; margin: 20px 0; }\n.skill-item { margin-bottom: 15px; }\n.skill-info {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    margin-bottom: 5px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: #ffffff;\n}\n.progress-bar-v2 {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 6px;\n    background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n}\n.progress-fill-v2 {\n    height: 100%;\n    background-color: #50FFD9;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(80, 255, 217, 0.4);\n    transition: width 1.5s ease-in-out;\n}\n</style>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>⭐ Key Features</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<ul><li><p data-path-to-node=\"20,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"20,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Real-time Client Portal:</b> Interactive dashboard for seamless client communication.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"20,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"20,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Optimized Image Delivery:</b> Automatic compression and scaling via Cloudinary.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"20,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"20,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Scalable Infrastructure:</b> Built to handle high traffic and complex service listings.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"20,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"20,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Unified Auth:</b> Secure and easy login system powered by Supabase.</p></li></ul>"
}